t on a larger scale. The company had commenced work, incurred substantial expenditure, and is evaluating its remedies _(~72.6% of mcap)_.","**Nila Infrastructures** — the Gujarat Housing Board has **cancelled the Nirmal Apartment redevelopment**, awarded in October 2023 for 300 HIG residential units and 18 commercial shops, and is returning the earnest-money deposit. The filing's annexure is a scan we could not read reliably, so no value is stated here."],"equity_allotments":["**Neetu Yoshi** — allots **26,42,400 warrants at Rs 104 each** on a preferential basis, convertible into an equal number of Rs 5 equity shares (new warrants; the filing states the count and price, and Rs 27.48 crore is our multiplication of the two)."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Hindustan Copper** — gives **prior intimation of a board meeting to consider raising funds by a Qualified Institutions Placement** of up to 9,69,76,680 equity shares, a stage below approval.","**Jindal Capital** — board approves raising **up to Rs 20 crore by a rights issue**; the issue price, entitlement ratio and record date are all still to be determined _(~84% of mcap, a ceiling)_.","**Anondita Medicare** — board resolves to issue equity shares on a rights basis in a 9,58,000 : 1,80,86,618 ratio, a day after receiving NSE's in-principle approval.","**Manas Polymers and Energies** — submits the final Letter of Offer for its rights issue.","**Jupiter Infomedia** — board resolves to **withdraw** its proposed preferential issue of warrants."],"m_and_a":["**Adani Power** — signs an agreement to sell its **entire stake in Coastal Ideal Power for a consideration of Rs 535.69 crore**, subject to adjustments on closing _(~0.1% of mcap)_.","**Indoco Remedies** — executes the **Deed of Conveyance for the sale of a plot of land for Rs 64 crore**, which it says neither affects business operations nor constitutes the sale of an undertaking _(~2.9% of mcap)_.","**Mahindra Lifespace Developers** — approves the **sale of its entire equity and compulsorily convertible stake in associate companies for Rs 80 crore** _(~1.0% of mcap)_; separately it is the counterparty awarding Capacit'e its Rs 741 crore construction order.","**GACM Technologies** — signs a **Memorandum of Understanding with Winfluential Private Limited** for a mandate with an estimated consideration of **Rs 25 crore** _(~22.9% of mcap; an MoU, not a definitive agreement)_.","**Osel Devices** — approves borrowing or investing an **aggregate not exceeding Rs 50 crore during FY 2026-27**, subject to shareholders, alongside raising authorised capital from Rs 20 crore to Rs 25 crore _(~7.2% of mcap, a ceiling)_.","**Texmaco Rail & Engineering** — signs a Memorandum of Understanding with Bochumer Verein Verkehrstechnik of Germany.","**Systematix Corporate Services** — subscribes **Rs 2.70 crore** to the rights issue of Systematix Wealth & Asset Services, its own wholly owned subsidiary; an intra-group transfer that changes no external holding."],"order_wins":["**Tejas Networks** — a **Letter of Intent worth Rs 1,537 crore from Tata Consultancy Services** for supply of RAN equipment, accessories and installation at sites; the detailed purchase order is to follow, and the filing refers back to the companies' communication of 21 May 2025 _(~17.1% of mcap)_.","**Skipper** — **fresh orders of Rs 1,305 crore** for power transmission and distribution projects across India and export markets, covering transmission lines and substations _(~21.1% of mcap)_.","**Capacit'e Infraprojects** — a **Rs 741 crore Letter of Intent excluding GST from Mahindra Lifespace Developers** for core-and-shell construction work, received in the normal course of business _(~38.5% of mcap)_.","**Viviana Power Tech** — a **Rs 9.74 crore turnkey contract including taxes from Gujarat Energy Transmission Corporation**, for laying, erection, testing and commissioning of 66kV XLPE cable in the Rajkot Zone over 24 months _(~1.3% of mcap)_.","**Winsol Engineers** — a Letter of Intent with an **aggregate order value of Rs 8.25 crore** _(~6.3% of mcap)_.","**TechD Cybersecurity** — an order worth **Rs 4.89 crore** _(~1.2% of mcap; SME)_.","**GK Energy** — issues the press release for the **Rs 454.50 crore rooftop-solar empanelment** covering 1,00,000 households, which was published as a top mover in yesterday's digest; the release adds that cumulative allocation now exceeds Rs 1,092 crore."],"other_notable":["**Great Eastern Shipping** — board approves a **buyback of up to Rs 900 crore** at a maximum price of Rs 1,530 a share, from all shareholders other than the promoter group _(~4.7% of mcap)_."]},"unlocks":[{"company":"Tanvi Foods (India) Limited","date":"2026-08-27","days":0,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"16834","mcap":64.4,"pct":0.26,"pct_of":"equity","shares":34000,"src":"BSE","symbol":"TANVI","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260826-15/20260826-15.pdf"},{"company":"Optiemus Infracom Limited","date":"2026-08-27","days":0,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"13635","mcap":5183.4,"pct":0.64,"pct_of":"equity","shares":572336,"src":"BSE+NSE","symbol":"OPTIEMUS","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260826-17/20260826-17.pdf"},{"company":"Indo Thai Securities Limited","date":"2026-08-27","days":0,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"13558","mcap":658.0,"pct":0.77,"pct_of":"equity","shares":1000000,"src":"BSE+NSE","symbol":"INDOTHAI","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260826-18/20260826-18.pdf"},{"company":"Filmcity Media Ltd","date":"2026-08-27","days":0,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"14975","mcap":6.1,"pct":38.33,"pct_of":"equity","shares":19000000,"src":"BSE","symbol":"FILME","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260826-23/20260826-23.pdf"},{"c